# Scheduling ElixirConf

[![Run in Livebook](https://livebook.dev/badge/v1/blue.svg)](https://livebook.dev/run?url=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2Felixir-tempo%2Fagenda%2Fmain%2Flivebook%2Felixir_melbourne_september_2026.livemd)

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:agenda, github: "elixir-tempo/agenda"},
  {:kino, "~> 0.19"}
])
```

## Agenda

